The normalizers:
- `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/TelephoneNumber.java` (lines 32-45): strips non-digits, keeps `+CC` when input starts with `+`, else assumes `+61` and drops a leading `0`.
- `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/PostalAddress.java` (lines 34-47): trims/collapses whitespace, upper-cases, expands `ST→STREET`, `RD→ROAD`, `AVE→AVENUE`.

