```
The derivation helpers used by the response DTO:
- `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/MembershipLevels.java:14-23` — level 1, +1 if email present, +1 if `namesakeCount == 0`, capped at 3.
- `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/Localities.java:27-30` — region from postcode range, falling back to a city table (else "UNKNOWN").
- `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/ContactPreferences.java:15-17` — "EMAIL" if email present else "PHONE".

